src/d3d/gpu/ (state.h, shaders.*, vertex.*, texture.*, backend.h, ext.h) is taken from TGP482's
Xbox XBE Recomp SDK (https://github.com/TGP482/Xbox-XBERecomp, runtime/gpu, commit 65e959d4,
2026-10-11; MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 TGP482), the general form of the renderer of
SCDA-XBERecomp (https://github.com/TGP482/SCDA-XBERecomp; MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 TGP482,
Joshhhuaaa), whose xdk/d3d8.cpp and gpu/d3d12.cpp src/d3d/hle.cpp and src/d3d/vk/backend.cpp
follow. Adapted to this project: Vulkan in place of Direct3D 12, Ninja Gaiden Black's D3D8LTCG conventions.
src/d3d/compat/ maps that code's host interfaces (guest memory, logging, DXGI format names) onto
this runtime.

